# Deliberately track README.md, CHANGELOG.md, ordinary project docs,
# composer.lock, go.mod, go.sum, pyproject.toml, Python lockfiles,
# requirements files, package lockfiles, source code,
# database migrations, and .github/workflows/.
# Libraries may explicitly adapt their lock/artifact policy.
